 "notes": "Sparse map: the OpenStreetMap shoreline of the Grüner Grenzlandsee (© OpenStreetMap contributors) with its two islands, and the entry placed on the east shore nearest the dive base address, Zur Grenze 14 (divers-guide: parking about 10 m from the water), so its position is approximate. The lake is about 550 m long and 16-18.5 m deep, densely overgrown to about 7 m, with a training platform, sunken objects such as tractors, and tame sturgeon, but their positions are not known, so they are left off.",
